# Cloudflare Pages evaluates this file top-down, first match wins — so all
# 301s must sit ABOVE the SPA fallback or they never fire.

# Canonical host: www → apex. One host in Google's index, not two competing
# duplicates. (Both hosts are attached to this Pages project.)
https://www.turnpagedigital.com/* https://turnpagedigital.com/:splat 301

# Legacy paths from the pre-May-2026 site structure.
/ai-copyright /copyright 301
/litigation-finance /litigation-funding 301
/legal /privacy 301

# Legacy intel filenames.
/intel/unified-docket.html /intel/docket.html 301
/intel/unified-calendar.html /intel/calendar.html 301
/intel/unified-notes.html /intel/notes.html 301
/intel /intel/ 301

# SPA fallback: serves index.html (200 status) for any path that isn't a
# static file or a Pages Function. Required for HTML5 history-mode routing so
# deep links like https://turnpagedigital.com/crypto work on initial load.
# functions/_middleware.js downgrades unknown routes to a real 404 status.
/*    /index.html   200
